  "You are a payments analyst. Using only the computed headline and Facts below, reply with JSON only:\n{\"headline\": <one sentence>, \"hypotheses\": [<possible cause>], \"recommendations\": [<next step>]}\nQuestion: Which bank got worse on cards in wk7?\nComputed headline: Success rate for card fell 1.8pp from wk6 to wk7; 101% of it is a rate change within banks, not a shift in traffic mix; Coastal Bank went from 91.5% to 77.8%.\nFacts:\n- Success rate wk6: 91.52%\n- Success rate wk7: 89.76%\n- Arya Bank Success rate change: 0.62pp\n- Bharat National Bank Success rate change: -0.09pp\n- Coastal Bank Success rate change: -13.71pp\n- Deccan Private Bank Success rate change: 0.06pp\n- Everest Bank Success rate change: -0.16pp\n- Fortune Bank Success rate change: -0.09pp\n- Global Trust Bank Success rate change: -0.23pp\n- Harbour International Success rate change: 0.14pp\n- Unknown bank Success rate change: -2.95pp": "{\"headline\": \"Coastal Bank got worse on cards: its card Success rate fell from 91.5% to 77.8% (-13.7pp) in wk7, which drives the 1.8pp drop in card Success rate; every other named bank moved less than 1pp.\", \"hypotheses\": [\"The drop is confined to one bank, so a problem on Coastal Bank's side, such as its card authorisation or 3-D Secure service, is the likely cause.\", \"The Unknown bank Segment's -2.95pp change may be noise rather than a second problem; check whether it sits inside its 95% interval in Exhibit A.\"], \"recommendations\": [\"Split Coastal Bank's wk7 card failures by failure reason and by day to find when the drop started.\", \"Raise the drop with Coastal Bank, sharing that failure-reason split.\", \"Consider routing Coastal Bank cards through a backup path until its rate recovers.\"]}",
